# 🌳 Binary Trees (Part 2) - Recursive Tree Problems

## 📌 Introduction

Most Binary Tree problems can be solved using **Recursion** because every tree is made up of smaller subtrees.

For every node, we can independently solve the problem for:

- Left Subtree
- Right Subtree

and then combine their results.

This recursive thinking is one of the most important skills for solving Tree problems.

