# 1️⃣ Recursive Tree Pattern

For most Binary Tree problems, start with:

```cpp
if(root == NULL)
    return ...;
```

Then solve:

```text
Left Subtree

+

Right Subtree

+

Current Node
```

General pattern:

```cpp
answer(left subtree)

answer(right subtree)

combine results
```

