# 8️⃣ Same Tree

## 📖 Problem

Determine whether two Binary Trees are identical.

Two trees are the same if:

- Their values are equal.
- Their structures are identical.

---

### Example

Tree A:

```text
    1
   / \
  2   3
```

Tree B:

```text
    1
   / \
  2   3
```

Result:

```text
true
```

---

### C++ Code

```cpp
bool isSameTree(Node* p, Node* q)
{
    if(p == NULL && q == NULL)
        return true;

    if(p == NULL || q == NULL)
        return false;

    if(p->data != q->data)
        return false;

    return isSameTree(p->left, q->left)
        && isSameTree(p->right, q->right);
}
```

---

### Complexity

```text
Time: O(n)

Space: O(h)
```

