# 💡 Interview Tips

✅ Always start with the `NULL` base case.

✅ Think about the left subtree and right subtree independently.

✅ Many Tree problems are solved using postorder-style recursion.

✅ For height-based problems, return the height from the recursive function.

✅ For Diameter and Balanced Tree, avoid repeatedly calculating subtree heights.

---

# ⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Forgetting the `NULL` base case.

❌ Confusing height and depth.

❌ Assuming the diameter must pass through the root.

❌ Checking only the root's balance instead of every node.

❌ Recalculating heights repeatedly and causing O(n²) solutions.

